        "body": "Canadian Commercial is concentrated in Military Armored Vehicle, Tank, and Tank Component Manufacturing with $439M in obligations. Canadian Commercial has a second major cluster in Explosives Manufacturing at $173M. Canadian Commercial obligations in aviation and related systems total $77.8M, $35.8M, and $31.8M across three NAICS categories."
      },
      {
        "heading": "How has Canadian Commercial trended over recent fiscal years?",
        "body": "Canadian Commercial obligations rose from $626M in FY21 to $1.4B in FY25, then moved to $879M in FY26. Canadian Commercial obligations for FY2026 to date are down 37.1% year over year. Canadian Commercial has 1,114 awards this fiscal year to date, with an average award size of $789K."
      }
